@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName PingFang SC
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 65
hide footbox
title UC05 办理图书归还顺序图
actor "图书管理员" as A
boundary ReturnUI as UI
control ReturnController as C
entity BorrowRecord as Loan
entity BookCopy as Copy
control ReservationController as RC
boundary NotifyBoundary as N
A -> UI : confirmReturn(borrowId, copyId)
UI -> C : confirmReturn(borrowId, copyId)
C -> Loan : get(borrowId)
Loan --> C : loan 或 null
C -> Copy : get(copyId)
Copy --> C : copy 或 null
alt 记录 ON_LOAN 且复本匹配且 ON_LOAN
 note over A,UI : 管理员核对实物并确认收回
 group 原子事务 T4
  C -> Loan : complete(borrowId, returnedAt)
  C -> Copy : release(copyId)
  note right of Copy : ON_LOAN -> AVAILABLE
  C -> RC : activate(bookId)
  ref over RC : 共享顺序图 预约激活 A1
  RC --> C : noticeList
 end
 opt noticeList 非空，事务提交后
  C -> N : sendReadyNotices(noticeList)
  ref over N : UC_EXT01 通知预约读者
  N --> C : 通知结果
 end
 C --> UI : 返回归还与预约激活结果
else 不存在或已归还或复本不匹配
 C --> UI : 拒绝归还，不重复恢复馆藏
end
UI --> A : 展示结果
@enduml
